واردسازی رابط گرافیکی.رابط کاربری

تابع ریشه:
    چاپ رابط کاربری.گزارش سند(`<!doctype html><html><head><style>body{margin:0;font-size:0;line-height:0}.s{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;background:#888}div.p{width:300px;background:#eee;margin-bottom:3px}.t{height:30px}</style></head><body><div class="p" id="p1"><span class="s t" id="a"></span><span class="s" id="b" style="vertical-align:sub"></span><span class="s" id="c" style="vertical-align:super"></span><span class="s" id="d" style="vertical-align:middle"></span><span class="s" id="e" style="vertical-align:text-top"></span><span class="s" id="f" style="vertical-align:text-bottom"></span><span class="s" id="g" style="vertical-align:7px"></span><span class="s" id="h" style="vertical-align:-4px"></span><span class="s" id="i" style="vertical-align:50%;line-height:20px"></span></div><div class="p" id="p2"><span class="s t" id="a2"></span><span class="s" id="j" style="vertical-align:top"></span><span class="s" id="k" style="vertical-align:bottom"></span><span class="s" id="l" style="vertical-align:top;height:50px"></span></div><div class="p" id="p3"><span class="s" id="m"></span><span class="s" id="n" style="vertical-align:bottom;height:40px"></span><span class="s" id="o" style="vertical-align:top;height:25px"></span><span class="s" id="q" style="vertical-align:-20px"></span></div></body></html>`، 640، 480)
    چاپ رابط کاربری.گزارش سند(`<!doctype html><html><head><style>body{margin:0;font-size:0;line-height:0}.s{display:inline-block;width:30px;height:10px;background:#888}div.p{width:100px;background:#eee;margin-bottom:3px}</style></head><body><div class="p" id="p1"><span class="s" style="height:20px"></span><span class="s" id="a" style="vertical-align:top;height:35px"></span><span class="s"></span><span class="s" id="b" style="vertical-align:bottom;height:30px"></span><span class="s" id="c" style="vertical-align:top"></span><span class="s" style="vertical-align:5px"></span><span class="s" id="d" style="vertical-align:bottom"></span></div><div class="p" id="p2" style="line-height:24px"><span class="s" id="e" style="vertical-align:top;height:4px"></span><span class="s" id="f" style="vertical-align:bottom;height:4px"></span><span class="s" id="g" style="vertical-align:middle;height:4px"></span></div><div class="p" style="width:200px"><span class="s" style="display:inline-flex;vertical-align:super;height:12px"></span><img id="im" style="width:20px;height:16px;vertical-align:-3px"><span class="s" style="display:inline-grid;vertical-align:top;height:40px"></span></div></body></html>`، 640، 480)
